# The bottom of a deep recursion is the deepest the stack has been: a big indirect-call frame there
# reaches past the guard page unless it is probed. Measured on cass with the probe removed: this row
# (2000 arguments, a 16 KB frame, at depth 20000) is 0xC0000005, and so is a 2000-argument call at
# depth 4000 in a program of its own; 1100 arguments (8.8 KB) survive. The callee takes five: a
# Win64 callee ignores stack arguments it does not declare.
fn few5(a0, a1, a2, a3, a4) { return a0 + a4 * 10; }
